{"id":"76151855abd85b5f","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-regular-ultraproduct-countable-saturation.md","title":"Countable Saturation of a Regular Ultraproduct","display":"thm-regular-ultraproduct-countable-saturation — Countable Saturation of a Regular Ultraproduct","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-regular-ultraproduct-countable-saturation","aliases":["17-thm-regular-ultraproduct-countable-saturation"],"display":"thm-regular-ultraproduct-countable-saturation — Countable Saturation of a Regular Ultraproduct","depends_on":["[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","[[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]]","[[17-df-ultraproduct]]","[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-4.6.1","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-regular-ultraproduct-countable-saturation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-regular-ultraproduct-countable-saturation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regular-ultraproduct-countable-saturation — Countable Saturation of a Regular Ultraproduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6d889fd6c75f33af\" href=\"?note=6d889fd6c75f33af\" title=\"17-df-regular-ultrafilter\">17-df-regular-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed1712b26584150e\" href=\"?note=ed1712b26584150e\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct\">17-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-4.6.1"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 为候选集合；下式用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\aleph_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\aleph_0)\\)</span> 检验其基数及后继条件。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为无限基数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\kappa\">\\(I=\\kappa\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in\\kappa}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in\\kappa}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>。这些是下式的自由参数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>语言符号集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> 与语言基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|L|\">\\(|L|\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a> 的接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa\\)</span> (regular-ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6d889fd6c75f33af\" href=\"?note=6d889fd6c75f33af\" title=\"17-df-regular-ultrafilter\">17-df-regular-ultrafilter</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L\\)</span> (ultraproduct predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ed1712b26584150e\" href=\"?note=ed1712b26584150e\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct\">17-df-ultraproduct</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda\\)</span> (saturation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\\)</span> (successor-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (least infinite cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;|L|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa(U)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in\\kappa},U,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\aleph_0)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda(\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;|L|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa(U)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in\\kappa},U,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\aleph_0)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda(\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A regular ultrafilter on an infinite index set is countably incomplete. This yields countable saturation in a countable language; regularity alone does not imply <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span>-saturation for arbitrary theories.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-regular-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"6d889fd6c75f33af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语言符号集 $\\operatorname{Sym}(L)$ 与语言基数 $|L|$ 取 [[17-df-language-cardinality]] 的接口。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-regular-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"6d889fd6c75f33af","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa$ (regular-ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L$ (ultraproduct predicate, see [[17-df-ultraproduct]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda$ (saturation predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S$ (successor-cardinal predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文"